---
title: How the phone learns what the Mac is doing
board: 1500x860
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Mac as Helm on the Mac
  participant Srv as Helm server (on the Mac)
  participant Ph as Helm Mobile
  Mac->>Srv: reportClientActivity · focused, thread scope (on focus, route change, 25 s)
  Srv-->>Ph: subscribeBackgroundPolicy · lease for the open thread
  Note over Ph: pill shows when the Mac is focused or touched in the last 2 min
  Ph->>Srv: hold mic · live words (on-device speech)
  Srv-->>Mac: composer.insert stream · text appears in the composer
  Ph->>Srv: let go · clip to voice.transcribe for the clean text
  Srv-->>Mac: replace the draft with the clean text
  Ph->>Srv: or swipe up · message.dispatch (steer or queue)
